## Performance Boundaries
// Referenced by:
// - @battle-movement-system.mdc#Performance#Animation-Requirements
// - @battle-visual-feedback.mdc#Performance-Standards
// - @battle-targeting-system.mdc#Performance-Considerations#Optimization

### Frame Rate Requirements
- 60fps baseline for all animations
  - Monitor using Performance.now()
  - Log drops below 55fps
  - Implement low-quality mode triggers
- Native driver utilization required
  - Use for all transform animations
  - Fallback gracefully for unsupported props
- Batched state updates
  - Group related visual changes
  - Use requestAnimationFrame for batching

